  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).<br>• In a medium bowl, combine the white wine vinegar <br>and a good pinch of sugar and salt.<br>• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add it <br>to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover <br>onion. Set aside.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-b5483500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, slice cucumber into thin half-moons.<br>• Slice lemon into wedges. Finely chop garlic.<br>• Thinly slice long chilli (if using). Roughly chop <br>coriander. Halve snacking tomatoes.<br>• Cut paneer into 3cm-thick slices. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-07b8dd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a second medium bowl, combine basic sponge <br>mix (see ingredients), Mumbai spice blend and <br>the salt. Gradually add the water (for the batter) to <br>make a batter (it should be thick but pourable).<br>• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with <br>enough olive oil to coat the base.<br>• When oil is hot, dip paneer into batter to coat and <br>immediately transfer to pan.<br>• Cook pakora in batches until golden, 2-4 minutes <br>each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate and <br>season with a pinch of salt.<br>TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the pakora does not stick <br>to the pan.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-ee1f1f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Crush long chilli (if using), garlic, half the coriander <br>and a pinch of salt with a pestle and mortar until it <br>resembles a fine paste.<br>• Transfer to a small bowl, then add Greek-style <br>yoghurt, a generous squeeze of lemon juice and a <br>splash of water. Stir until well combined.<br>TIP: Some like it hot, but if you don’t just hold back on <br>the chilli. <br>TIP: If you don’t have a pestle and mortar, finely chop <br>ingredients to form a chunky, rustic sauce! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-028a7130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain pickled onion.<br>• In a large bowl, combine gourmet leaf mix, pickled <br>onion, cucumber, tomatoes and a drizzle of olive <br>oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-afcd6840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cherry tomato salad between plates.<br>• Top with crispy paneer pakora.<br>• Drizzle over green chutney and tamarind chutney.<br>• Garnish with remaining coriander and serve with <br>any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4708b0acda55604b6d18a8/step-9350a350.jpg"
    }
  ]
